  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Multisectoral Humanitarian Response for Vulnerable Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM is implementing a six month, multisectoral humanitarian response to support vulnerable returnees, displaced households, and host communities across South Sudan. The project combines safe onward transportation assistance (OTA), life-saving shelter/non-food item support, and critical water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) supplies, ensuring rapid, dignified, and protection sensitive assistance in areas affected by large scale displacement and the Sudan crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
